# Real SVS log files you drop here for the "choose from prepared Excel files" button on
# the upload screen (see README). These can contain other alliances' player names, etc.,
# so they're never committed by default — whether to ship them with the folder is a
# per-distribution decision, not something git should decide for you.
# files/*.xlsx

# Claude Code — local project settings/permissions, machine-specific.
.claude/

# VSCode / JetBrains — local editor/workspace settings, machine-specific.
.vscode/
.idea/

# macOS / Windows filesystem cruft.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editor swap/backup files.
*.swp
*.swo
*~
